#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TideLink Chiplet Bridge - Pynq-Z2 Single-Instance Timing Constraints (Wave B1)
# A joint work commissioned on behalf of SoC Labs, under Arm Academic Access license.
#
# Contributors
